/INNPAR-PPG2ABP/
/PaPaGei/

# Intentionally NOT ignored:
# - source code and shell/Slurm entry points
# - configs without secrets or machine-specific paths
# - manifests containing only file identity, counts, and SHA-256 values
# - audited aggregate CSV/JSON/Markdown/LaTeX paper tables
# - publication figures and PDFs that contain no row-level patient data
